-- Mixed surfaces over an English registry (s51), ASCII twin. Statement 1 is plain English; statement 2 mixes a kanji alias (北 via ja) and Latin nouns in one line — aliases are surface-agnostic, so the ASCII surface says 北 too.
--! registry ../registries/01-canonical-masked-update.reg
--! expect gold = 2100 200 300 2400 500 600

Nord & TwoHanded > 60 , Gold += 1000
北 & TwoHanded > 60 , 金 += 1000
